d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鄜州","place_name_jianti_auto":"鄜州","start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"8c3bd475-db0e-11ef-b309-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"洛交縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"洛交县","start_index":65,"tongjian_id":"8c3bd476-db0e-11ef-9175-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"犀首，魏官名。公孫衍爲此官，因號犀首，猶虎牙將軍之稱。龍姓出於龍伯氏，或云出於御龍氏。班志，上郡有雕陰道。括地志：雕陰故城，在鄜州洛交縣北二十里。敗，補邁翻。稱，尺證翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"犀首，魏官名。公孙衍为此官，因号犀首，犹虎牙将军之称。龙姓出于龙伯氏，或云出于御龙氏。班志，上郡有雕阴道。括地志：雕阴故城，在鄜州洛交县北二十里。败，补迈翻。称，尺证翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"8c3bd469-db0e-11ef-a9ab-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"言引兵東下也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"言引兵东下也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"8c3bd479-db0e-11ef-a003-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_td_description":"龙贾，战国时人，魏国将领。","link_td_id":"Q10020822","link_td_number_id":6814135,"people_name":"龍賈","people_name_jianti_auto":"龙贾","people_xingming":"龙贾","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"8c3bd47c-db0e-11ef-a3df-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/五、延安府（卷五十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"汉置县。三国魏时县废。旧《志》云：雕阴城在鄜州北三十里。...","context_before":"○雕阴城[县南四十里。战国时魏地。","source_end_index":63,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"cc3014eb-fb2d-5016-a8e0-1f2ee11827b3","source_start_index":17,"source_text":"周显王三十六年，秦犀首伐魏，取雕阴。《史记》：梁襄王五年，秦败我龙贾军四万五千于雕阴。是也。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/五、延安府（卷五十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"會秦使犀首伐魏，大敗其師四萬餘人，禽將龍賈，取雕陰，且欲東兵。蘇秦恐秦兵至趙而敗從約，念莫可使用於秦者，乃激怒張儀，入之於秦。","content_fanyi":"恰逢秦国派犀首率军攻打魏国，大败魏军四万余人，擒获魏将龙贾，夺取魏国城邑雕阴，并准备向东进兵。苏秦担心秦军打到赵国会破坏合纵盟约，考虑到没有合适的人可派往秦国用计，于是激怒张仪，使他前往秦国。","content_jianti_auto":"会秦使犀首伐魏，大败其师四万余人，禽将龙贾，取雕阴，且欲东兵。苏秦恐秦兵至赵而败从约，念莫可使用于秦者，乃激怒张仪，入之于秦。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":187,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二 (周紀二) / 顯王 / 三十六年 / 第 5 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8c3bd468-db0e-11ef-915f-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-333},"tongjian_id":"8c3bd468-db0e-11ef-915f-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1}],"page_size":7,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":1},"profile":{"alias_list":[],"biography":"龙贾，战国时人，魏国将领。","link_td_id":"Q10020822","name":"龙贾","number_id":6814135},"relationships":[]},"message":"success","success":true}